The server runs directly on a cgroup v2 host, in a login session cgroup
without limits ("max"). The root cgroup has no cpu.max or memory.max files
at all. Nothing NVIDIA.
-- proc/meminfo --
MemTotal:       8000000 kB
MemAvailable:   7000000 kB
-- proc/self/cgroup --
0::/user.slice/user-1000.slice/session-1.scope
-- sys/fs/cgroup/cgroup.controllers --
cpuset cpu io memory pids
-- sys/fs/cgroup/user.slice/user-1000.slice/session-1.scope/cpu.max --
max 100000
-- sys/fs/cgroup/user.slice/user-1000.slice/session-1.scope/memory.max --
max
